@startuml
' =============================================================================
' GTNH Platform — User Flow: Layers & Mods
' Слои: engine / game / content / apps, границы моддинга
' =============================================================================

title **Flow L0: Слои исходников и границы моддинга**

package "src/engine" #438D80 {
  [Registry] as Registry
  [Sim Infra] as SimInfra
  [Net] as Net
  [Storage Interfaces] as Storage
}

package "src/game" #E67E22 {
  [Machines] as Machines
  [Recipes] as Recipes
  [Quests] as Quests
  [Mining] as Mining
}

package "src/content" #9B59B6 {
  [data/] as Data
  [content.cpp] as ContentReg
}

package "src/apps" #5899DA {
  [simcore] as SimcoreApp
  [gateway] as GatewayApp
  [game_client] as ClientApp
}

actor "Модпак GTNH" as Modpack

Modpack --> Data : данные (items.csv, recipes, patterns, fuels, fluids)
Data --> ContentReg : загрузка
ContentReg --> Machines : register machine ids / balance
ContentReg --> Recipes : register recipes / conditions
ContentReg --> Registry : items.csv validation

Registry --> SimInfra : strict canonical loader
SimInfra --> Machines : tick, pattern matcher
Net --> SimcoreApp : io_uring frames
Storage --> SimcoreApp : interfaces

Machines --> SimcoreApp
Recipes --> SimcoreApp
Quests --> SimcoreApp
Mining --> SimcoreApp

SimcoreApp --> GatewayApp : MessageRouter pub/sub
GatewayApp --> ClientApp : TCP 7777/7778

note right of ContentReg
  Content layer — только данные + тонкая регистрация
  Никаких GTNH-констант в engine/game коде
end note

note right of Modpack
  Modding scope boundaries:
  - C++ data packs L0 разрешены
  - Lua/Python runtime и sidecar-моды
    ПЕРМАНЕНТНО исключены
  - Runtime choice (.so vs VM) отложен
end note

note bottom of Registry
  engine не знает game/content
  game → engine only
end note

@enduml

' ===========================================================================
' 1. Регистрация контента при старте приложения
' ===========================================================================
@startuml layers-registration
title **Flow L1: Регистрация контента при старте приложения**

actor "Apps::main" as Main
participant "src/content/content.cpp" as Content
participant "src/game/MachineRegistry" as GameMachines
participant "src/game/RecipeManager" as GameRecipes
participant "src/engine/Registry" as EngineReg

Main -> Content : load data/ items.csv, recipes, patterns
Content -> EngineReg : validate items.csv (strict)
EngineReg --> Content : canonical ids
Content -> GameMachines : register machine ids (e.g. Boiler=1110:011:1)
GameMachines --> Content : ack
Content -> GameRecipes : register recipes with ids
GameRecipes --> Content : ack

note right #E74C3C
  Никаких хардкод id в game/engine
  Ids передаются при регистрации
end note

@enduml

' ===========================================================================
' 2. Запрет мод-рантайма
' ===========================================================================
@startuml mods-scope
title **Flow L2: Границы моддинга**

actor "Разработчик мода" as Dev
participant "src/content/data" as DataPack
participant "src/content/content.cpp" as ThinReg
participant "Lua/Python VM" as VM
participant "Sidecar .so" as Sidecar

Dev -> DataPack : добавить JSON/YAML рецепты, предметы
Dev -> ThinReg : добавить регистрацию id (опционально)
DataPack --> ThinReg
ThinReg --> DataPack

note right of VM
  НЕ поддерживается
  Lua/Python runtime permanently excluded
end note

note right of Sidecar
  НЕ поддерживается
  Sidecar mod binaries excluded
end note

Dev -[dashed]-> VM : X
Dev -[dashed]-> Sidecar : X

@enduml
